Likely R or a genuine tossup.", "confidence": "medium", "notes": ["Open seat: Mark Amodei (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Mark Amodei's retirement opened Nevada's 2nd District, the state's most Republican seat, and David Flippo enters as the favorite over Democrat Teresa Benitez-Thompson. The district's seven-point Republican lean, Flippo's fundraising edge of roughly nine to one, and outside groups spending on his behalf frame the race. Most race raters call it Likely Republican, though three moved to Lean Republican in early October, and prediction markets give the Democrat about a one-in-four chance.\n\nThe race has drawn unusual attention because of Flippo's troubles: reports that he exaggerated a Bronze Star, his 2008 removal as a squadron commander, and carpetbagger attacks. The few available polls, all from late summer, show a single-digit contest rather than a blowout. A Democratic-leaning national environment keeps the seat within reach, but the Republican starts clearly ahead.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.213, "margin": -4.52}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2977, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2868, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2952, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2127, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2908, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.3379, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.3508, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.3896, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.3448, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.3118, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2576, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2807, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.1915, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2968, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.3004, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2172, "margin": -5.0}, {"da